target

# On most branches, cimstructs/src/*.rs and cimvalidation/src/generated* are
# produced locally by `make generate` (cargo run -p cimgen) and gitignored.
#
# The `vendor/gridoxide` branch is an exception: it exists specifically to
# let gridoxide (https://github.com/m-mirz/gridoxide) consume cimdecoder/
# cimstructs as a pinned git dependency, since neither crate is published to
# crates.io. That requires the generated sources to actually be committed on
# this branch, so the ignore rules below are relaxed here via `git add -f`
# rather than by rewriting the patterns themselves (keeping this file
# identical to `main` except for this comment, so a future merge/rebase from
# `main` doesn't fight the ignore rules).
cimstructs/src/*.rs
!cimstructs/src/base.rs
cimvalidation/src/generated*
cimoxide-py/python/cimoxide/types.pyi

__pycache__
*.so
*.out.xml